  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/yamaha/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/yamaha/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a row of the data list's MIDI parameter change tables, with its printed name. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "Parameter change: F0 43 1n 7F 1C 04 <address> <data> F7, n the device number (the deviceId variable is 1n, 10H for device number 1); bulk dumps are asked for with 2n and answered with 0n, both taken as device number 1.",
    "Identity: the reply the data list prints, F0 7E 7F 06 02 43 00 41 52 06 00 00 00 7F F7.",
    "The reface sends and receives control changes for its panel only with MIDI Control on (the system setting); this profile edits by parameter change, which the data list prints for every setting, and does not map the control changes.",
    "Pull: Bulk dump request (SYSTEM Common); Bulk dump request (TG Common). 22 of 22 parameters are read back."
  ],
